{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 91939, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 64467, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "减防机制与穿甲BUFF分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1636673495, "updated_at": 1650547896, "updated_uid": 75614, "comment_at": 1638248161, "last_at": 1682311556, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "前言在天命之子游戏中，伤害公式影响着玩家的决策，天子的强弱本质上也由这些机制决定着。此攻略给大家分析减防的作用与穿甲BUFF的强势之处。机制分析以重击TS的伤害公式为例，在不考虑特殊补正，战场BUFF", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636617170264_79181344.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5130, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 91939, "content": "<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">前言</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">在天命之子游戏中，伤害公式影响着玩家的决策，天子的强弱本质上也由这些机制决定着。此攻略给大家分析减防的作用与穿甲BUFF的强势之处。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">机制分析</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">以重击TS的伤害公式为例，在不考虑特殊补正，战场BUFF时，其可以简化为：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636617170264_79181344.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636617170264_79181344.png\" alt=\"减防机制与穿甲BUFF分析\" style=\"height:75.764px;width:367.778px;\"></div></span></div><div style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(46,117,181);font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">Tip1：上式为防御力≥5000时，下式为防御力≤5000时</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><br style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tip2：总攻击力包括天子的面板攻击力，以及进入副本后由BUFF，魂卡提供的攻击力</span><br style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\">Tip3：技能攻击力与天子的技能伤害有关，但并非面板标识数值，换算公式为：</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><font face=\"黑体\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">技能面板伤害</font><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">=技能攻击力+原始攻击力x0.3125</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">Tip4：伤害量BUFF即为各种增益BUFF，如己方弱点伤害增加，TS伤害增加，敌方暴击防御降低，弱点防御降低</span></span><br style=\"\"></span></p><br style=\"\"><p style=\"\"></p><span style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);font-weight:bold;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">大家会发现，</span><b style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(46,117,181);\">弱点防御，暴击防御等一堆带</font>“防御”字眼的Debuff，实际最后都归属于伤害公式中分子的“伤害量BUFF”，当其为负数时，只对总伤害百分比削弱，</span></b><b style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">单纯的</font>“防御”才是分母，如果不削减为零，会与总伤害做除法，而除法的威力大家小学就学过，所以其是我们提高伤害的“心头大患”</b><b style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\"><span style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">）</font></span></b></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span>因此，在DC中，防御数值对伤害影响非常大<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">【这也是红防强势的原因之一，就算将防御减到零，红防仍能不受减防影响，独立进行减伤计算】</span></font></b></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></b></p></span></font></b></div></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">科普完防御力的重要性，我们再来讲减防机制，其公式为：</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b style=\"text-indent:48pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">【目标防御数值</font>×（1－百分比减防+百分比增防）】－数值减防+数值加防</span>值加防</span></b></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:48pt;text-align:left;\"><br style=\"\"></p></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(46,117,181);font-weight:bold;font-size:12pt;\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">注：总项最低为零</font></span></b></p><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp; 举个例子，木伞SS技能有乱舞之刃百分比减防20%+数值减防1495的效果，目标防御力为2000，并且有防御力百分比增幅10%的BUFF，那么此时目标的防御力数值为：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-indent:48pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\"></font><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">【目标防御数值（2000）</font>×（1－百分比减防（乱舞20%）+百分比增防（10%））】－数值减防（1495）</span></span></span></span></b><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">你可以发现，当敌方拥有百分比防御增幅时，己方的百分比减防效果会大打折扣，因为其与目标的防御力增幅为加算方式，此时木伞基本无法用来竞速</span><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">【日服上一期raid便是如此】</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">穿甲BUFF强势原因</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp; 日服新出天子杜鹃的TS拥有“穿甲”BUFF，字面技能描述为百分比无视敌方防御力，但实际上它的威力远远不止这样，在我测试韩服BOSS防御数值时，发现其真实效果为：<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">在最终的防御力上进行百分比减防</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">，</span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">也就是说穿甲BUFF可以无视防御力增幅的BUFF，直接与最终防御进行结算，非常霸道！！！</span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(0,176,240);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(46,117,181);\">举个例子，目标防御2000，防御力百分比增幅为200%，木伞乱舞之刃百分比减防20%，数值减防1495。再加上穿甲效果50.6%，此时目标防御数值为：</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-indent:48pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"\">【2000</font>×（1－20%+200%）－1495<b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-indent:48pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:12pt;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">】x(1－50.6%）【穿甲效果】</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></b><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">可以看出，穿甲BUFF在面对拥有高额防御力百分比增幅的BOSS时，减防幅度会远超其他天子，是目前最强的单体增伤BUFF之一。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">尾言</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">日服新出的对策刀杜鹃TS自带“穿甲”BUFF，意味着水队高练度阵容可以做到五色斩车，其强度将远远超过其他种类的刀，开创新一代raid刀的格局。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:700;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">——ID：xiaoxin</font></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:700;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">2021.11.11</font></p></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636617170264_79181344.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 75614, "username": "xiaoxin", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "玩游戏就是要开心嘛", "follow_num": 250, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status"